# Any creature's death counts, a token's too (CR 700.4), and a noncreature permanent's does not. On turn 1 Bot1 sacrifices Black Lotus (an artifact, not
# a creature) for {B}{B}{B} and casts Drag the Canal with the Sapphire's {U} and one {B}: only the Detective, life stays 20. Then in the same main phase
# it spends the other two {B} on Terror for that Detective token (a creature that ceases to exist) and casts a second Drag the Canal: now it gains 2,
# surveils 2 and investigates.

